  {
   "index": 3,
   "tag": "ul",
   "landmarks": [],
   "textLength": 909,
   "text": "The Astra pelicans are much better. The very best GPT-5.6-Sol pelican (I liked xhigh better than max) is still pretty clearly a bunch of abstract shapes. Every single one of the Astra pelicans, from low to xhigh, looks better than that. The Astra max one is really good.\nAstra below max still doesn’t reliably get the pelican legs on both sides of the frame.\nIn terms of cost, Astra may be around twi",
